1
00:00:00,838 --> 00:00:02,105
East Berlin. November 9th, 1989.

2
00:00:02,292 --> 00:00:03,599
This wall has stood twenty-eight years.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,513
It falls TONIGHT — and right now nobody knows.

4
00:00:05,956 --> 00:00:06,431
Not them.

5
00:00:06,744 --> 00:00:07,606
Not the guards.

6
00:00:07,736 --> 00:00:08,887
ESPECIALLY not the government.

7
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,808
The eighties happened on BOTH sides of the wall.

8
00:00:12,326 --> 00:00:14,054
Warmth: 8 out of 10.

9
00:00:14,524 --> 00:00:16,620
Volume of this jacket: also 8.

10
00:00:18,802 --> 00:00:20,586
So it's a hot dog... inside the bread?

11
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:21,669
[Vendor] It is engineering.

12
00:00:21,821 --> 00:00:23,339
6 out of 10. The ketchup carries.

13
00:00:23,462 --> 00:00:24,483
The engineering is load-bearing.

14
00:00:25,332 --> 00:00:26,330
[TV — Schabowski] ...sofort... unverzüglich.

15
00:00:26,523 --> 00:00:27,082
[Patron] He is reading it wrong.

16
00:00:27,419 --> 00:00:28,238
How do you know?

17
00:00:28,394 --> 00:00:29,975
[Patron] He is Politburo. They are never accidentally generous.

18
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:33,915
He just ended the Cold War by accident. Live on television.

19
00:00:35,052 --> 00:00:35,789
And he doesn't know.

20
00:00:36,477 --> 00:00:40,835
It said 'immediately.' I heard it. Come — I'll walk with you.

21
00:00:41,204 --> 00:00:42,747
[Margot] Twenty-eight years I have waited.

22
00:00:43,094 --> 00:00:45,467
[Margot] I can wait for you to find your glove.

23
00:00:46,357 --> 00:00:49,528
[Werner] In 2026. The telephones. What are they like?

24
00:00:49,862 --> 00:00:51,472
Everyone carries one. Nobody calls.

25
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:53,499
[Werner] ...So the Stasi won.

26
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:58,132
[Crowd] TOR AUF! (Open the gate!)

27
00:01:07,292 --> 00:01:11,046
NOBODY pushes. We win by STANDING here.

28
00:01:16,837 --> 00:01:17,275
Corks.

29
00:01:18,437 --> 00:01:19,129
Just corks.

30
00:01:21,133 --> 00:01:23,333
Thousands of rabbits live between the walls.

31
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:25,633
Safest place in Berlin — if you're a rabbit.

32
00:01:26,384 --> 00:01:27,166
Their kingdom ends tonight.

33
00:01:35,675 --> 00:01:36,575
[Hanne] MARGOT?!

34
00:01:41,417 --> 00:01:42,814
No shots. No plan.

35
00:01:43,337 --> 00:01:46,207
One bureaucrat's bad note cards, and a hundred thousand people who took him at his word.

36
00:01:46,433 --> 00:01:48,517
At least a hundred and forty people died trying to cross this wall.

37
00:01:48,776 --> 00:01:50,410
Tonight, everyone just... walked.

38
00:01:50,581 --> 00:01:51,617
I didn't think it would hit like this.

39
00:01:51,617 --> 00:01:52,417
Hazel — out of time.

